#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: rsdev-custom-cart-settings.php
msgid "Custom Cart Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen Winkelwagen"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Update URI of the plugin
#: rsdev-custom-cart-settings.php
msgid "https://github.com/ron273/rsdev-custom-cart-settings"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: rsdev-custom-cart-settings.php
msgid ""
"Enables shop owners to force orders in multiples of X (e.g. boxes containing "
"6 bottles of wine)."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee kunnen winkeleigenaren bestellingen afdwingen in veelvouden van X "
"(bijv. dozen met 6 flessen wijn)."

#. Author of the plugin
#: rsdev-custom-cart-settings.php
msgid "Ronald Smit"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: rsdev-custom-cart-settings.php
msgid "https://www.rsdev.nl/"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-admin.php:106
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-cart-validator.php:129
msgid "Proceed to checkout"
msgstr "Doorgaan naar afrekenen"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:38
msgid "Order Quantities"
msgstr "Bestelaantallen"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:66
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "Regel"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:67
msgid ""
"Customers can only check out when the number of counted products in their "
"cart is a multiple of the product multiplier."
msgstr ""
"Klanten kunnen alleen afrekenen als het aantal getelde producten in hun "
"winkelwagen een veelvoud is van het ingestelde veelvoud."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:72
msgid "Enable plugin"
msgstr "Plugin activeren"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:79
msgid "Product multiplier"
msgstr "Veelvoud"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:80
msgid ""
"The number of counted products in the cart must be a multiple of this "
"number. Use 1 to allow any quantity."
msgstr ""
"Het aantal getelde producten in de winkelwagen moet een veelvoud van dit "
"getal zijn. Gebruik 1 om elk aantal toe te staan."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:92
msgid "Excluded categories"
msgstr "Uitgezonderde categorieën"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:93
msgid "Products in these categories do not count towards the multiple."
msgstr "Producten in deze categorieën tellen niet mee voor het veelvoud."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:100
msgid "Choose categories…"
msgstr "Kies categorieën…"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:110
msgid "Customer message"
msgstr "Melding voor klanten"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:111
msgid "Shown in the cart and at checkout when the cart does not meet the rule."
msgstr ""
"Wordt getoond in de winkelwagen en bij het afrekenen als de winkelwagen niet "
"aan de regel voldoet."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:116
msgid "Error message text"
msgstr "Tekst melding"

#. translators: "%s" is shown literally; it is the placeholder admins type in the message.
#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:118
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Use %s to insert the multiplier value. Leave empty to use the default text."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik %s om het veelvoud in te voegen. Laat leeg om de standaardtekst te "
"gebruiken."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:127
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Voorbeeld"

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:148
msgid ""
"The plugin is enabled, but with a product multiplier of 1 every quantity is "
"allowed, so the rule has no effect. Set the multiplier to 2 or higher."
msgstr ""
"De plugin is actief, maar met een veelvoud van 1 is elk aantal toegestaan, "
"dus de regel heeft geen effect. Stel het veelvoud in op 2 of hoger."

#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:198
msgid ""
"The product multiplier must be a whole number of 1 or higher. The previous "
"value has been kept."
msgstr ""
"Het veelvoud moet een geheel getal van 1 of hoger zijn. De vorige waarde is "
"behouden."

#. translators: %s: comma separated list of IDs.
#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings-page.php:230
#, php-format
msgid "These IDs are not product categories and have been removed: %s"
msgstr "Deze ID's zijn geen productcategorieën en zijn verwijderd: %s"

#. translators: %s: the number of products the cart must be a multiple of.
#: includes/class-rsdev-ccs-settings.php:63
#, php-format
msgid "You can only order in multiples of %s."
msgstr "Je kunt alleen bestellen in veelvouden van %s."
